- Text: `is`, `isNot`, `contains`, `doesNotContain`, `isEmpty`, `isNotEmpty`
- Number: `is`, `isNot`, `isGreater`, `isLess`, `isGreaterEqual`, `isLessEqual`
- Date: `is`, `isBefore`, `isAfter`, `isWithin`

